{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were discarded the moment you drew your first breath. Weak, useless, nothing but a statistical failure. Thrown into an abyss\u2026 The end of the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through <strong>cursed</strong> paths toward the <strong>malevolent</strong> peak, where, so they say, something incredible awaits. No one has ever made it that far.<br>And yet\u2026 you keep jumping.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One single action:</strong> Jump. Every leap is designed to look easy. It never is.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique atmosphere:</strong> Sounds and visuals crafted to disguise the hell that awaits you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless playtime:</strong> From 2 hours to 2 years, depending on the instability of the path\u2026 and the stubbornness of the climber.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FERTILIZE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952230/9ae82aaf2ca585059afb0b57527f07bed7bbd295.jpg"},{"name":"HALFWAY THERE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952230/82d3d0e1ba9a6530fc9d5fa01bfe4910ce6bfef3.jpg"},{"name":"THE LAST ONE LEFT!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952230/710a8a4c3dd4b73856a789cd3dc33c92a1baba33.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952230?t=1761328338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952230/494f1095ffea53f98ee54eba7708e075712b7457/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761328338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952230/4cff729e0f71ebfa20f7b477ac91c4a98dae7598/capsul